# Upstream dsh (deepseek-harness) commit pinned for the build-time vendor tree
# (vendor/harness-packages/@deepseek-ai) — the declarative twin of the gitlink
# recorded in the git submodule at vendor/harness-checkout. Read by
# scripts/dev/ensure-harness-vendor.mjs, which HARD-FAILS when the submodule
# HEAD differs from this pin (single source of truth: the submodule; this file
# is the independent declaration that --check enforces equality against).
# Upgrade ONLY via `node scripts/dev/update-vendor.mjs <tag>` — never by hand.
# Keep in sync with pnpm-lock.yaml: bumping without regenerating the lockfile
# makes `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` fail (intended reproducibility guard).
